{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gods are impatient. Don\u2019t keep them waiting.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermes Runner is a fast-paced parkour game set to the backdrop of an alternate universe Greek city defined by its hyper-capitalist Pantheon. Traverse the city as quickly as possible to please your celestial boss, and tag things along the way to be stylish while doing it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-based movement system</strong> - Master a momentum based movement system to navigate the city. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/40bb471ee5240b6524cc86df9faf31e7.poster.avif?t=1745099006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/40bb471ee5240b6524cc86df9faf31e7.webm?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/40bb471ee5240b6524cc86df9faf31e7.mp4?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliveries to colorful characters</strong> - Engage with colorful, voice-acted characters that give a glimpse into the alternate reality setting. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/ea8db72a6b22ca429af84e24a0bb3266.poster.avif?t=1745099006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/ea8db72a6b22ca429af84e24a0bb3266.webm?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/ea8db72a6b22ca429af84e24a0bb3266.mp4?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray painting, sticker tagging, paint bombs</strong> - Leave your mark on the city with unique tags. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/6f931fa4e014fa4ba152997d02c7de00.poster.avif?t=1745099006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/6f931fa4e014fa4ba152997d02c7de00.webm?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/extras/6f931fa4e014fa4ba152997d02c7de00.mp4?t=1745099006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermes' Runner is produced by Hermes Devs LLC, a member owned indie studio brought to you by senior students at Utah Games. We hope you enjoy early access, and we hope you keep up with our upcoming final touches!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536730?t=1745099006","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536730?t=1745099006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/c4382c3ea4cca1e782523cca3a9d906e0d293bdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745099006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/c4382c3ea4cca1e782523cca3a9d906e0d293bdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745099006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":